:''Attacks against Starred Aliens are much more powerful!''
The '''Lunar Citrine''' is one of the [[Cats of the Cosmos]] [[Treasure]]s. It reduces the +1600% buff that [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]] have by default.

==Effect==
The [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] decrease the initial +1600% stat magnification applied to all [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]]' base health and base attack power.

For example, a hypothetical Starred Alien has base health and attack power of 1,000, but the default stat magnification applied to Starred Alien base stats is +1600%, making the enemy's health and damage from each hit 16,000.

Each fully activated Lunar Citrine, [[Stellar Garnet]], [[Phoebe Beryl]], [[Ganymede Topaz]] and [[Callisto Amethyst]] Treasure set reduces the +1600% default magnification by -100% (additively) such that the Starred Alien's base attack power is always 1,000 but the default magnification effect applied to produce the enemy health and damage output is reduced as shown below.

